flowchart TD
  %% Review & Critique ESG Flow (conceptual, updated to reflect code changes)
  Start([Start]) --> LoadData["Load preprocessed report/dataset"]
  LoadData --> Segment["Segment report into chunks for retrieval"]
  Segment --> Store["Store chunks in index (ChunkStore) via chunk_store.put(report_id, chunks) and record parse timing"]

  subgraph DomainLoop [Iterative critique-and-adjust loop per domain]
    direction TB
    BeginDomain["Begin evaluation for a single domain (environmental/social/governance)"] --> RetrieveInitial["Retrieve initial evidence (top relevant chunks, REVIEW_MAX_CHUNKS)"]
    RetrieveInitial --> InitialEstimate["Analyst produces initial estimate: score, confidence, rationale (estimate_domain_score)"]
    InitialEstimate --> IterationStart["Set up rounds counter and prepare for critique rounds (max REVIEW_MAX_ROUNDS)"]

    IterationStart --> CritiqueDecision{ "Should we attempt critique rounds? (rounds < max)" }
    CritiqueDecision -- Yes --> RetrieveCritique["Retrieve targeted critique evidence (REVIEW_CRITIQUE_CHUNKS)"]
    RetrieveCritique --> CritiqueStep["critique_and_adjust proposes revised estimate and returns stats['adjusted']"]
    CritiqueStep --> WasAdjusted{ "Was the judgment adjusted? (stats['adjusted'])" }
    WasAdjusted -- Yes --> Update["Accept revision: update current score; increment conflicts & resolved counters; continue rounds"]
    WasAdjusted -- No --> EndRounds["No change — stop iterative critique"]
    Update --> CritiqueDecision
    CritiqueDecision -- No --> EndRounds

    EndRounds --> Finalize["Finalize domain score after critique rounds; record used chunks and append RetrievalEvent to trace"]
    Finalize --> StoreDomain["Save domain score & proceed to next domain"]
  end

  DomainLoop --> Deliberation["Compute deliberation summary (conflicts, resolved, dominance ratio) -> deliberation_quality"]
  Deliberation --> Aggregate["Aggregate domain scores into final total and compute confidence (aggregate_total_score, aggregate_confidence)"]
  Aggregate --> Evaluate["Compute metrics: coverage, hallucination, agreement, latency, MAE/accuracy, deliberation metrics"]
  Evaluate --> Compare["Compare predicted total to ground truth; prepare comparison stats"]
  Compare --> Result["Produce final run result (pattern=review_critique) with domain scores, traces, metrics, metadata{conflicts,resolved}"]
  Result --> End([End])

  %% Key differences: iterative critique rounds use critique_and_adjust and REVIEW_* constants; conflicts/resolutions tracked; dominance ratio computed; higher agent calls and latency but more deliberation
  classDef note fill:#e8f7ff,stroke:#333,stroke-width:1px;
  Note["Key: iterative critique & adjustment → REVIEW_MAX_ROUNDS iterations possible; REVIEW_CRITIQUE_CHUNKS used each round; track conflicts & resolved; dominance ratio influences deliberation stats"]:::note
  DomainLoop --> Note
